/specs/
# Scratch output of the three-brain skill (reviewer reports).
three-brain-out/
.worktrees/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI documentation & logs
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md are deliberately LOCAL-ONLY in this repo (CI skips the
# one test that reads them). rheox tracks both as project deliverables; to adopt
# that here, delete the two lines below and `git add` the files.
CLAUDE*.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
GROK.md
HERMES.md
OPENROUTER.md
WARP.md
codex.md
CONTEXT.md
PROGRESS.md
RELEASE_GUIDE.md
.research-log.jsonl
CLAUDE_QUALITY_SUMMARY.json
CODE_QUALITY_REPORT.md

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documentation (Sphinx)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/_build/
docs/build/
docs/api/generated/
.doctrees/
*.doctree
/site

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Graphify (knowledge graph & semantic cache)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EXACTLY three files are tracked: GRAPH_REPORT.md, graph.html, graph.json.
# Everything else graphify writes here (cache/, manifest.json, cost.json,
# .graphify_root, .graphify_python, label signatures, dated snapshots) is
# regenerable from `graphify update .` and does not belong in a commit. The
# last two carry machine-specific absolute paths.
#
# `graphify-out/*` rather than a deny-list, so new sidecar files graphify adds
# later are excluded by default. The negations work because the directory
# ITSELF is not excluded, only its contents, so git still descends.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/graph.html
!graphify-out/graph.json

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDEs & editors
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
.spyderproject
.spyproject
.ropeproject
*.swp
*.swo
*~
\#*\#
.\#*
tempCodeRunnerFile.py

